    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUCK YOU MACHINE is a 1st person single player fast session arena shooter with time limit. You have 15 seconds to make 303 decisions find weapons and to get more time by killing  enemies and destroying the barrels </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.poster.avif?t=1751028169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.webm?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.mp4?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade you character by collecting skill point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find all the ways to finish the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish the level to unlock the next one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >double uzi // shotgun // mp3 gun or other classical weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay the level to find all the secrets and alternative routs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >run through // arena // or boss modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>start // shoot // die // respawn</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.poster.avif?t=1751028169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.webm?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.mp4?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The distant future, the year 2030. </strong>A portal opened on the Moon, spewing forth demons from the FUM-dimension.\u00a0<strong>DJ Oguretz </strong>had a worldwide  tour planned and  aliens were seriously cramping his style. So he grabbed his collection of CD-Rs, freshened up his hairdo and hit up the planet\u2019s most rave spots to restore order - because the party must go on.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUCK YOU MACHINE is a 1st person single player fast session arena shooter with time limit. You have 15 seconds to make 303 decisions find weapons and to get more time by killing  enemies and destroying the barrels </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.poster.avif?t=1751028169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.webm?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/7e1c46736a599990fab7a9b11d08896e.mp4?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade you character by collecting skill point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find all the ways to finish the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish the level to unlock the next one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >double uzi // shotgun // mp3 gun or other classical weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay the level to find all the secrets and alternative routs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >run through // arena // or boss modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>start // shoot // die // respawn</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.poster.avif?t=1751028169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.webm?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/86be6a0bca311b7d1a526baf9c8d90e8.mp4?t=1751028169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The distant future, the year 2030. </strong>A portal opened on the Moon, spewing forth demons from the FUM-dimension.\u00a0<strong>DJ Oguretz </strong>had a worldwide  tour planned and  aliens were seriously cramping his style. So he grabbed his collection of CD-Rs, freshened up his hairdo and hit up the planet\u2019s most rave spots to restore order - because the party must go on.</p>",
